Regie Ocampo posted a new assignment in Robotics 9-Einstein 9-Einstein  
<https://classroom.google.com/c/MTIxODQxNzkyNDQ2>.

Due: Feb 3
2ndQtr-Act4: Valentine LED matrix
Create a LED matrix with a Valentine in tinkercad application using  
breadboard, Arduino Uno, LED and resistors. Program the LEDs to at least 5  
transitions. Post your simulated activity that shows the 5 transitions and  
program code.
OPEN  
<https://classroom.google.com/c/MTIxODQxNzkyNDQ2/a/MjY2MzE5ODk2MTA1/details>
